{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_2","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc 'rg -n \"''^(def main|def generate_input|'\"\\\\s+Input structure:|\\\\s+Rule:|\\\\s+Key insight:)\\\" /home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/dbff022c.py /home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/d749d46f.py /home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/2d0172a1.py /home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/ac6f9922.py /home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/7491f3cf.py /home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/b9e38dc0.py /home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/305b1341.py /home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/320afe60.py\"","aggregated_output":"/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/320afe60.py:40:def main(grid: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/320afe60.py:44:    Input structure:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/320afe60.py:49:    Rule:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/320afe60.py:54:    Key insight:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/320afe60.py:297:def generate_input() -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/b9e38dc0.py:6:def main(grid: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/b9e38dc0.py:10:    Input structure:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/b9e38dc0.py:13:    Rule:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/b9e38dc0.py:17:    Key insight: The wall endpoints define the opening direction; fill radiates outward through it, and obstacles block propagation along that same axis.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/b9e38dc0.py:532:def generate_input() -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/305b1341.py:21:def main(grid: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/305b1341.py:348:def generate_input() -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/7491f3cf.py:8:def main(grid: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/7491f3cf.py:12:    Input structure:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/7491f3cf.py:18:    Rule:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/7491f3cf.py:23:    Key insight: The cue panel's isolated indicator and wall partition the tile into inside/outside masks that select between the two source panels.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/7491f3cf.py:265:def generate_input() -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/ac6f9922.py:17:def main(grid: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/ac6f9922.py:259:def generate_input() -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/2d0172a1.py:208:def main(grid: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/2d0172a1.py:212:    Input structure:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/2d0172a1.py:217:    Rule:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/2d0172a1.py:223:    Key insight: The exact wobbly geometry is irrelevant; only enclosure plus relative sibling positions define the output.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/2d0172a1.py:693:def generate_input():\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/d749d46f.py:31:def main(grid: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/d749d46f.py:226:def generate_input() -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/dbff022c.py:274:def main(grid: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/dbff022c.py:278:    Input structure:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/dbff022c.py:282:    Rule:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/dbff022c.py:287:    Key insight: The palette's edge position and orientation determine reading direction; border colors in the palette uniquely key into fill colors.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/dbff022c.py:544:def generate_input():\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
